DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270109
SUMMARY:Deadline: RJI Professional Innovation Fellowships 2027 (Individual\
 , Institutional and Emerging Technology tracks)
DESCRIPTION:The Reynolds Journalism Institute at the University of Missouri
  funds people and teams to build and launch a tool\, workflow or product t
 hat helps newsrooms\, in three tracks: Individual (USD 75\,000)\, Institut
 ional (USD 75\,000\, paid to a host organisation or the fellow) and Emergi
 ng Technology (USD 100\,000\, where AI or another new technology must be e
 ssential to the solution). The output must be a free\, open-source resourc
 e usable by US journalists\; tools limited to one city or state are unlike
 ly to be funded. The fellowship is remote and runs for eight months from 2
 8 June 2027 with an in-person kickoff at RJI and a couple of paid visits. 
 ELIGIBILITY: anyone\, anywhere\; no age\, background or journalism credent
 ial required. Applications open 2 November 2026 on Submittable\; a shortli
 st is invited in early to mid February 2027 to submit a fuller application
 \, with finalist interviews 5 to 23 April 2027. DEADLINE: 8 January 2027 (
 first round\; no time zone stated\, RJI is on US Central time).\n\nOrganis
 ation: Reynolds Journalism Institute (University of Missouri)\nLocation: R
 emote\, with a few paid visits to the Reynolds Journalism Institute in Col
 umbia\, Missouri\, United States.\nAward: USD 75\,000 for the Individual a
 nd Institutional tracks\, USD 100\,000 for the Emerging Technology track\,
  paid in three instalments tied to deliverables\; RJI also pays for the fe
 llow's visits to its Columbia\, Missouri campus. No application fee.\nDura
 tion: Eight months from 28 June 2027.\n\nMore: https://rjionline.org/about
 -rji-fellowships/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referra
 l
URL:https://rjionline.org/about-rji-fellowships/?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote\, with a few paid visits to the Reynolds Journalism Institu
 te in Columbia\, Missouri\, United States.
END:VEVENT
